{
  "label": "Sync the docs",
  "description": "Apply each change's doc_updates, and write verified_by onto each unit doc (feature.md §5 step 8). A coding agent, because it edits files.",
  "inputs": {
    "changes": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    "unit_tests": {
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      }
    },
    "unit_docs": {
      "kind": "text",
      "schema": {
        "type": "string"
      }
    }
  },
  "outputs": {
    "docs_touched": {
      "kind": "json",
      "binding": {
        "op": {
          "kind": "function",
          "functionRef": "op.member",
          "input": {
            "value": {
              "kind": "json",
              "binding": {
                "op": {
                  "kind": "function",
                  "functionRef": "op.member",
                  "input": {
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "json",
                      "binding": {
                        "op": {
                          "kind": "function",
                          "functionRef": "context.get",
                          "input": {
                            "name": {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "binding": {
                                "text": "operation"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "output": {
                            "name": "value",
                            "kind": "json"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "prop": {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "binding": {
                        "text": "output"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "output": {
                    "name": "value",
                    "kind": "json"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "prop": {
              "kind": "text",
              "binding": {
                "text": "docs_touched"
              }
            }
          },
          "output": {
            "name": "value",
            "kind": "json"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "docs_touched"
    },
    "verified_by": {
      "kind": "json",
      "binding": {
        "op": {
          "kind": "function",
          "functionRef": "op.member",
          "input": {
            "value": {
              "kind": "json",
              "binding": {
                "op": {
                  "kind": "function",
                  "functionRef": "op.member",
                  "input": {
                    "value": {
                      "kind": "json",
                      "binding": {
                        "op": {
                          "kind": "function",
                          "functionRef": "context.get",
                          "input": {
                            "name": {
                              "kind": "text",
                              "binding": {
                                "text": "operation"
                              }
                            }
                          },
                          "output": {
                            "name": "value",
                            "kind": "json"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    "prop": {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "binding": {
                        "text": "output"
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "output": {
                    "name": "value",
                    "kind": "json"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "prop": {
              "kind": "text",
              "binding": {
                "text": "verified_by"
              }
            }
          },
          "output": {
            "name": "value",
            "kind": "json"
          }
        }
      },
      "name": "verified_by"
    }
  },
  "operation": {
    "kind": "prompt",
    "user": "Make the docs true again, in the same sitting as the code.\n\n## The changes that landed\n\n{{.inputs.changes}}\n\n## The tests that defend them\n\n{{.inputs.unit_tests}}\n\n## The unit docs\n\n{{.inputs.unit_docs}}\n\n_Paths — open them with `read_file`._\n\n## What to do\n\n**Apply every change's `doc_updates`.** Each change declared which docs it makes\nwrong the moment it lands. Edit those docs now — not as a follow-up, because a\nstale doc costs more than a missing one and nobody comes back.\n\n**Write `verified_by` onto each unit doc.** For every invariant, name the test\nthat asserts it and where that test lives. This is the durable half of the\ntraceability spine: a reader arriving next quarter with no run in front of them\ncan follow the invariant to the assertion that defends it.\n\nAn invariant with no test does not get a vague `verified_by` line — it should\nalready have come back as a design finding. If you find one here that did not,\nsay so rather than papering over it.\n\n## What to produce\n\n`docs_touched` — every path you edited.\n\n`verified_by` — one row per unit doc: the invariant, the test that asserts it,\nand the test's path.\n",
    "config": {
      "model": "claude-cli/default"
    },
    "input": {},
    "output": {
      "name": "output",
      "kind": "json",
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "docs_touched": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "verified_by": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "docs_touched",
          "verified_by"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "environment": {
    "tools": [
      "read_file"
    ]
  },
  "slotMeta": {
    "inputs.changes": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.unit_tests": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "inputs.unit_docs": {
      "optional": true,
      "description": "Path to unit_docs. Read it with read_file — the file as it is now, not a copy taken at state entry."
    }
  }
}
